{"id":786534,"title":"11｜智能客服Agent：整体设计流程解析","content":"智能客服系统通过集成一段JavaScript代码至网页实现聊天窗口功能，用户可自定义窗口标题、描述及颜色。系统流程始于创建会话线程，调用服务端接口star开启会话。成功后，系统发送预设欢迎信息并等待用户提问。用户输入的问题通过chat接口传递给大语言模型处理，模型基于向量化的基本话术和信息生成回复。若接口调用失败，则返回错误提示。此外，系统收集用户详细信息（如姓名、电话等）及其购买意向，汇总提交至后台表单供销售跟进。整个过程中，前端与后端协同工作，确保持续的交互体验。该设计使智能客服能够模拟人类交流方式，提供个性化服务，并简化销售流程。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":392314,"user_name":"nick","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1061843,"ip_address":"北京","ucode":"91263882076AC0","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/10/33/d3/30a89b21.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1720585683,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":142624,"content":"哈哈这个不是开源的，可以继续学习，学习到fastgpt这个框架。这个开源。开完成一样的功能。","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1719027,"ctime":1720787277,"ip_address":"山东","comment_id":392314,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":3,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100775901,"comment_content":"这个设计流程的工具是开源的吗","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1719027,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/1a/3a/f3/106ff941.jpg","nickname":"周文洋","note":"","ucode":"61D85493E804D1","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":647926,"discussion_content":"哈哈这个不是开源的，可以继续学习，学习到fastgpt这个框架。这个开源。开完成一样的功能。","content_length":46,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1720787277,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"山东","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":2,"child_discussions":[{"author":{"id":1641662,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/19/0c/be/ee3e52cf.jpg","nickname":"魏龙云","note":"","ucode":"7D6B5D9DA359A8","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":1719027,"avatar":"https://static001.ge